Pehlu bhi shikasta hai turbat bhi shikasta hai..(3)<br />
Kya haal yeh ummat ne..(2) zehra ka banaaya hai<br />
<br />
1. Khatoon koi gham se yun choor nahi dekhi<br />
aisi koi duniya me mastoor nahi dekhi<br />
atthaara baras me hi lagti jo zaeefa hai<br />
<br />
2. Darbaar mai zaalim ne ki aisi pazeeraai<br />
kis tarha se tu bibi phir laut ke ghar aayi<br />
baalon ki safedi ne sab haal sunaaya hai<br />
<br />
3. Tu roti rahi ghar mai haider se bhi chhup chhup ke<br />
ismat ki tarha dukh bhi parde mai rahe tere<br />
kuch dard tere bibi bas jaanti fizza hai<br />
<br />
4. Do aise janaaze hai taariki me jo utthe<br />
bas ghar ke hi logon ne dono ko diye kaandhe<br />
ek fatema zahra hai ek baali sakina hai<br />
<br />
5. Marham tere zakhmon ka bibi na milaa ab tak<br />
aulaade umayya ki baaqi hai jafaa ab tak<br />
rone pe bhi pehra tha turbat pe bhi pehra hai<br />
<br />
6. Mismaar tera roza ummat ne kiya jab se<br />
baba tera rehta hai turbat pe teri tab se<br />
kab ghumbad-e-khizra me baba tera rehta hai<br />
<br />
7. Mehdi se koi puchhe kya uss pe guzarti hai<br />
awaaz baqayya se jab rone ki aati hai<br />
aankhon se lahu rokar woh bhi yehi kehta hai<br />
<br />
8. Tasweer haqiqat ki khwaabon ko banaadije<br />
aye bibi &ldquo;takallum&rdquo; ko taabir dikhaadije<br />
matam teri turbat pe hote huwe dekha hai<br />
<br />
9. Hasrat hai yahi maula har matami seene mein<br />
aap aaaye to ho maatam jee bhar ke madine mein<br />
har matami seene par likkha ye areeza hai<br />
<br />
10. Wo karbobala ho ya mash'ad ho ke samarrah<br />
yasrab ho najaf ho ya zindaan ka darwaza<br />
har simt yahi bibi jaari tera girya hai<br />
